      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WYNDRA ALL SASS (5) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 23.55 beating Rocky Ride. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from six starts. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. GREAT TERMS (1) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish third, beaten 1.75 lengths, (23.86) at this track. Well-placed to take this out. HIGH PRAYER (3) goes very well this course and distance starting nine times for four wins and two minors. Comes off a (23.50) win last time, scoring by half a length in a Grade 4 over 407m at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. MR. WILLIAMS (2) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
